translate chinese strings:

    # game/chapters/02/ch_02_03-Thursday.rpy:69
    old "Yoo! The girls told me you're all good now. Msg me back when you have time 👍🏻"
    new "哟！女孩们告诉我你现在没事了。有时间给我回个消息👍🏻"

    # game/chapters/02/ch_02_03-Thursday.rpy:73
    old "Sup! I'm good, but thanks for checking up on me. How are you?"
    new "嗨！我很好，谢谢关心。你怎么样？"

    # game/chapters/02/ch_02_03-Thursday.rpy:74
    old "Happy to hear that! Ngl, you got me scared. Go get some rest 💤. Talk to you later, bro!"
    new "很高兴听到这个！说实话，你吓到我了。去休息一下💤。晚点再聊，兄弟！"

    # game/chapters/02/ch_02_03-Thursday.rpy:75
    old "Nah, I'm good, seriously. So, whatcha up to?"
    new "不，我很好，真的。那么，你在忙什么？"

    # game/chapters/02/ch_02_03-Thursday.rpy:77
    old "Just checking out the clubs we could visit."
    new "只是在看看我们可以去的俱乐部。"

    # game/chapters/02/ch_02_03-Thursday.rpy:78
    old "Oh, nice. Found a good one yet?"
    new "哦，不错。找到好的了吗？"

    # game/chapters/02/ch_02_03-Thursday.rpy:79
    old "Not really... I'm starting to think it might not be the best idea."
    new "不太好……我开始觉得这可能不是个好主意。"

    # game/chapters/02/ch_02_03-Thursday.rpy:80
    old "I mean, I'm looking through the reviews, and there's this: \"{b}SeatDown_78{/b}: Don't even get me started on the questionable hygiene of the seating. I felt like I needed a hazmat suit just to sit down.\""
    new "我是说，我在看评论，这里有这个“{b}SeatDown_78{/b}：别让我开始说座位的卫生问题。我感觉我需要一套防化服才能坐下。”"

    # game/chapters/02/ch_02_03-Thursday.rpy:81
    old "Or this one: \"{b}Kritikal_Trinker{/b}: Just like the staff, the drinks here suck. I swear, I've had more enticing cocktails at a preschool tea party.\""
    new "或者这个“{b}Kritikal_Trinker{/b}：就像这里的员工一样，饮料也很糟糕。我发誓，我在幼儿园茶会上喝到的鸡尾酒都比这更有吸引力。”"

    # game/chapters/02/ch_02_03-Thursday.rpy:83
    old "And another one: \"{b}TheAlbanianKING{/b}: It's less seduction, and more awkward gymnastics. You'll be squirming in your seat, not from excitement, but from the sheer cringe-worthy spectacle unfolding before your eyes.\""
    new "还有这个“{b}TheAlbanianKING{/b}：这里不是诱惑，而是尴尬的体操。你会坐在座位上扭动，不是因为兴奋，而是因为眼前那令人尴尬的景象。”"

    # game/chapters/02/ch_02_03-Thursday.rpy:85
    old "Uhm. This one seems okay: \"{b}Tits-And-Tats{/b}: Nestled in the heart of what can only be described as 'the seedy underbelly of the city,' lies \"Heartbreaker,\" a strip club defying expectations in more ways than one.\""
    new "嗯。这个看起来还可以“{b}Tits-And-Tats{/b}：位于城市‘阴暗角落’的中心，有一个名为“Heartbreaker”的脱衣舞俱乐部，它进而对超乎你的预期。”"

    # game/chapters/02/ch_02_03-Thursday.rpy:86
    old "Yeah. That one sounds good."
    new "诶。那个听起来不错。"

    # game/chapters/02/ch_02_03-Thursday.rpy:87
    old "Have you been to a club before?"
    new "你去过俱乐部吗？"

    # game/chapters/02/ch_02_03-Thursday.rpy:89
    old "No, not yet, but I'm kinda excited!"
    new "没有，还没去过，但我有点兴奋！"

    # game/chapters/02/ch_02_03-Thursday.rpy:90
    old "Same! Need some decent clothes, tho."
    new "一样！不过我们需要一些像样的衣服。"

    # game/chapters/02/ch_02_03-Thursday.rpy:91
    old "Anyway, didn't want to bother you with all that while you're still recovering. I'm just so... excited."
    new "无论如何，不想在你还在恢复的时候打扰你。我只是……太兴奋了。"

    # game/chapters/02/ch_02_03-Thursday.rpy:92
    old "Even more than when we invaded the Eldritch realms last campaign! Gonna message you when I have something! Maybe we can go next weekend when my parents aren't home."
    new "甚至比我们上次入侵Eldritch领域时还要兴奋！我有消息的时候会告诉你！也许我们可以在下周末我父母不在家的时候去。"

    # game/chapters/02/ch_02_03-Thursday.rpy:94
    old "Haha, don't worry!"
    new "哈哈，别担心！"

    # game/chapters/02/ch_02_03-Thursday.rpy:95
    old "Sound perfect. Just tell me when."
    new "听起来真不错。告诉我什么时候。"

    # game/chapters/02/ch_02_03-Thursday.rpy:100
    old "Will do!"
    new "会的！"

    # game/chapters/02/ch_02_03-Thursday.rpy:101
    old "Crap. My clan just breached a new dungeon in World of Walls, gtg!"
    new "糟糕。我的公会在WorldofWalls里刚刚突破了一个新地牢，得走了！"

    # game/chapters/02/ch_02_03-Thursday.rpy:117
    old "Tread lightly."
    new "小心行事。"

    # game/chapters/02/ch_02_03-Thursday.rpy:130
    old "Write back."
    new "回信。"

    # game/chapters/02/ch_02_03-Thursday.rpy:130
    old "Ignore it."
    new "忽略它。"

    # game/chapters/02/ch_02_03-Thursday.rpy:136
    old "Who is this?"
    new "你是谁？"

    # game/chapters/02/ch_02_03-Thursday.rpy:137
    old "The message could not be delivered."
    new "消息无法送达。"

